      "**My minimum investment:** $________",
      "**My target investment:** $________",
      "**My stretch investment:** $________",
      "**Investment account:** __________",
      "**Brokerage:** __________",
      "**Investment goal:** __________",
      "**Monthly review date:** __________",
      "Now you've turned a vague idea—\"I should invest more\"—into an actual plan.",
      "## MapleSheet Takeaway",
      "You don't need to invest the same amount as the person next to you. You don't need to invest $1,000 every month. You don't need to wait until you have a large amount of money. You need a number that fits your life. Maybe that's $25. Maybe $100. Maybe $500. The important thing is to start with an amount you can maintain, increase it when your financial situation improves, and track your progress along the way. Small contributions can become meaningful when you give them time.",
      "And remember: start small. Stay consistent. Increase gradually. Track everything. That's the MapleSheet approach to building better investing habits.",
