      "## DCA Can Help Remove Emotion From Investing",
      "Investors are human. That means emotions can influence decisions. When markets rise: \"I should buy more before it goes even higher!\" When markets fall: \"I need to sell before it gets worse!\" This cycle can lead investors to buy when prices are high and sell when prices are low. A predetermined contribution plan can help create discipline. Instead of asking \"What should I do today?\" you've already established: \"This is my investing plan.\" That doesn't mean you should blindly continue forever. You should still review your investments and make sure they remain appropriate for your goals.",
      "## DCA Is Not a Guarantee of Profit",
